exports[`email templates render byte-for-byte as before the renderer swap > MagicLink (defaults) > text 1`] = `
"--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Crouton Test

Hi Ada,

Click the link below to sign in to your Crouton Test account.

Sign in [https://app.example.test/magic?t=abc]

Or copy this URL into your browser:
https://app.example.test/magic?t=abc [https://app.example.test/magic?t=abc]

This link expires in 10 minutes. If you didn't request this, you can safely
ignore this email.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Crouton Test"
`;

