exports[`email templates render byte-for-byte as before the renderer swap > PasswordReset (defaults) > text 1`] = `
"--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Crouton Test

Hi Ada,

Someone requested a password reset for your account. Click the link below to
choose a new password.

Reset password [https://app.example.test/reset?t=abc]

Or copy this URL into your browser:
https://app.example.test/reset?t=abc [https://app.example.test/reset?t=abc]

This link expires in 10 minutes. If you didn't request this, you can safely
ignore this email.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Crouton Test"
`;

